</div>
<div id="u-credit-00299-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6606914&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605988661" alt="kaster-k" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6606914)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;">kaster-k</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1593913228 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">05 Jul 2020 01:40</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00319/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一台电影院用投影仪。在使用时会自动将恐怖片和动漫片、喜剧片和纪录片、科幻片和魔幻片交换。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>█达电影院的一间放映室内。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">被放置于基金会员工休息区</span> 收容于Site-CN-09的标准异常物品收容柜里。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong> 为什么会有人把这玩意放在员工休息区里！——Noah特工<br />
Noah看上去吓得不轻，他本打算用它追动漫来着。——Jacob特工</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00319" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00319" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00319-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lanperouge" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6332347); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6332347&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605988661" alt="lanperouge" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6332347)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lanperouge" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6332347); return false;">lanperouge</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1594918263 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">16 Jul 2020 16:51</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00209/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一副圆规，在被使用时两腿间距会以每秒0.05cm的速度扩大。该圆规在两腿间距最大时将不会再扩大。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/05/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>研究员仗助的办公室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放于Site-CN-██低价值异常物品仓库中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>我终于知道为什么我的圆规总是用不好了</em>——研究员仗助<br />
<em>啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊我要疯啦！这什么[脏话已编辑]圆规！</em>——试图正常使用的Jo███博士<br />
<em>有一说一，用这个圆规画螺旋线挺好用的</em>——研究员Oku████</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00209" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00209" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00209-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/higashikatajosuke" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6150792); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6150792&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605988661" alt="HigashikataJosuke" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6150792)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/higashikatajosuke" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6150792); return false;">HigashikataJosuke</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589638016 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">16 May 2020 14:06</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00212/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一块黑板，无法使用任何书写工具在项目上留下任何痕迹（比如使用粉笔时，粉笔灰会直接落下，而不是附着在黑板上）<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>上海市███初级中学<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于Site-CN-██的低价值物品收容室中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>你们感受过在黑板上花了一整支粉笔都写不出一个字，然后底下的学生一直在哄笑的感觉吗？</em>——潜伏在███中学的特工fan</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00212" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00212" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00212-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605988661" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589937568 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">20 May 2020 01:19</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00070/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一条牛仔裤，无论何人于何时穿上这条牛仔裤，去何地，排队购买何种商品，排到他时，该商品一定断货，且该商品一天之内得不到进货。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██服装店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>特工EVIL的藏品，使用中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>不仅穿上它的人遭殃，排在他后面的人也得遭殃。</em>——特工EVIL<br />
<em>特工EVIL他爹是卖炸鸡块的，特工EVIL家对面也是卖炸鸡块的，特工EVIL为了帮他爹打败竞争对手，每天都穿上这条牛仔裤去对面买炸鸡块,这样对手就没得卖了</em>——Dr.shadeoi</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00070" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00070" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00070-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/steven-the-shadow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6316800); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6316800&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605988661" alt="Steven the shadow" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6316800)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/steven-the-shadow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6316800); return false;">Steven the shadow</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587091447 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">17 Apr 2020 02:44</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
    
